  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN258.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">allakuṟip paṭṭa talaimakaṉ taṉ neñciṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE, who had been led astray by a wrong sign, said to his heart.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN258.1">
        <l>naṉṉa ṉutiya ṉaruṅkaṭip pāḻit</l>
        <l>toṉmutir vēḷi rōmpiṉar vaitta</l>
        <l>poṉṉiṉu marumainaṟ kaṟintu maṉṉōṭ</l>
        <l>ṭuṉṉala mātō veṉiṉumaḵ tollāy</l>
        <l>taṇmaḻai tavaḻun tāḻnīr naṉantalaik</l>
        <l>ka<supplied>ṭu</supplied>ṅkāṟ ṟe<supplied>ṭu</supplied>kku neṭumperuṅ kuṉṟattu</l>
        <l>māya viruḷaḷai māykaṟ pōla</l>
        <l>māykatil vāḻiya neñcē nāḷu</l>
        <l>melliyaṟ kuṟumaka <supplied>ṇa</supplied>llaka nacaii</l>
        <l>yaravirai tēru mañcuvaru ciṟuneṟi</l>
        <l>yiravi ṉeytiyum peṟāa yaruḷvarap</l>
        <l>pulleṉ kaṇṇaip pulampukoṇ ṭulakat</l>
        <l>tuḷḷōrk kellām perunakai yākak</l>
        <l>kāmaṅ kaimmika vuṟutara</l>
        <l>vāṉā varumpaṭar talaittan tōyē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="3a-c">Even though you knew well she was more precious than the gold</l>
        <l corresp="2">stored by the ur-ancient Vēḷir who defended</l>
        <l corresp="1">Pāḻi hill, under Naṉṉaṉ Utiyaṉ’s fierce protection,</l>
        <l corresp="4">even though we said “we shall not approach one like her?” you did not agree with that,</l>
        <l corresp="7">like a stone disappearing in a hole of deceptive darkness</l>
        <l corresp="6">on a tall big hill, where the fierce wind takes up</l>
        <l corresp="5">the water coming down on the vast area covered by cool clouds,</l>
        <l corresp="8a-c">would that you disappeared – may you live, heart –</l>
        <l corresp="11">you who did not, although night arrived, out of consideration [for me] find</l>
        <l corresp="10">the fearful small path where snakes seek for prey,</l>
        <l corresp="8d-9">daily yearning for the good bosom of the soft-natured little woman,</l>
        <l corresp="12a-c">you with useless eyes, taking loneliness [upon you],</l>
        <l corresp="15">you who have brought [me] unending heavy affliction,</l>
        <l corresp="14">so that we suffered exceedingly from [our] passion,</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13">to be a great laughter to all those who exist in the world.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

